{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to make authentic sushi at Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the ingredients according to the order, combine them with sushi rice, and serve the sushi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difference between success and failure is your deftness and speed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can play together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the high score! Aim for the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to serve as much sushi as possible within the time limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't make any mistakes in your order, you will get a bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The trick is to serve the sushi efficiently, paying attention to the leftover ingredients and sushi rice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How to play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\u3001Check your order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\uff0cCut the ingredients that need to be cooked first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u3001Select the ingredients and nigiri the sushi to complete the dish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score Attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is all about how accurately and speedily you can respond to orders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for a high score and challenge the world ranking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can battle it out for sushi!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against each other in terms of speed, accuracy, and dexterity to determine who is the true sushi chef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738720?t=1749684680","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/stor